nebflow.core.tools.DelegateToolSpec:
  + schema: exactly task/name/project/executor/worktree/force/mode — legacy parameters stay gone 0.003s
  + name parameter: short-name guidance is model-visible (dispatch prompt face) 0.001s
  + description carries the hard facts (self-contained brief / delegate: address / no concurrency cap) 0.001s
  + summarize: task first-line label — stray keys must NOT surface 0.001s
  + task is required: empty task fails with a self-describing error 0.001s
  + kernel definition missing => fail-safe built-in def, NOT a refusal (kernelgen-ext 2026-09-26) 0.003s
  + code-defined def: stray disk files CANNOT influence the kernel prompt (single source = code, builtin-def 2026-10-03) 0.005s
  + code-defined def carries the kernel contract (when-to-use / boundary / plugin pointer) 0.001s
  + unified-delegate: default workspace is created and the call reaches spawn prerequisites 0.001s
  + unified-delegate: an unmounted project is an explicit refusal, nothing spawned 0.003s
  + continuation address: the receipt-facing constant is the delegate: form 0.0s
  + no agent library: resolution no longer depends on it — the call reaches the spawn prerequisites 0.001s
  + target is fixed to the built-in kernel def — a non-kernel agent named in the call is impossible 0.001s
  + depth limit still applies (kernel is a leaf, depth < MaxDepth required) 0.002s
  + no hard concurrency limit: description and the code-defined prompt carry the no-limit wording in sync 0.0s
  + the concurrency gate stays retired at the source face (the 5th concurrent spawn is admitted - nothing rejects it) 0.001s
  + device face removed: a stray device key is NOT consumed — the call proceeds to the spawn prerequisite 0.001s
  + device face removed 负控: no device parameter ⇒ identical behaviour (local runs are the only mode) 0.002s
  + nebflow tool face = BaseTools + AskUserQuestion + Subagent + AgentFlow (10 items) and excludes orchestration/message tools 0.0s
  + subagent tool face is read-only five — no write, no shell, no message 0.001s
  + nebflow agent.json declaration is inert (ConvergedAgentNames) — mechanism-fixed only 0.0s

